# Mutation plan for [D-950]: the system posts fire the message and consumed hooks, and the two
# system posts this server had never written (the creator's join post, the default-channel join
# posts) are written.
#
#   scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/plugin-hooks-system-posts.plan
#
# The oracle is the `parity::plugin_hooks` module. The last two lines are the no-op controls and
# must SURVIVE.

